{
    "chapter_num": 20,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Abraham and Abimelech"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Abraham journeyed from there to the South, and dwelt between Kadesh and Shur, and stayed in Gerar. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Abraham said of Sarah his wife, “She "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " my sister.” And Abimelech king of Gerar sent and took Sarah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But God came to Abimelech in a dream by night, and said to him, “Indeed you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a dead man because of the woman whom you have taken, for she "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. married to a husband"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a man’s wife.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Abimelech had not come near her; and he said, “Lord, will You slay a righteous nation also? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Did he not say to me, ‘She "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " my sister’? And she, even she herself said, ‘He "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " my brother.’ In the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "innocence"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "integrity of my heart and innocence of my hands I have done this.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God said to him in a dream, “Yes, I know that you did this in the integrity of your heart. For I also withheld you from sinning against Me; therefore I did not let you touch her. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now therefore, restore the man’s wife; for he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a prophet, and he will pray for you and you shall live. But if you do not restore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "her,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " know that you shall surely die, you and all who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " yours.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Abimelech rose early in the morning, called all his servants, and told all these things in their hearing; and the men were very much afraid. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Abimelech called Abraham and said to him, “What have you done to us? How have I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "sinned against"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "offended you, that you have brought on me and on my kingdom a great sin? You have done deeds to me that ought not to be done.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Abimelech said to Abraham, “What did you have in view, that you have done this thing?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Abraham said, “Because I thought, surely the fear of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not in this place; and they will kill me on account of my wife. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But indeed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "she is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " truly my sister. She "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the daughter of my father, but not the daughter of my mother; and she became my wife. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it came to pass, when God caused me to wander from my father’s house, that I said to her, ‘This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your kindness that you should do for me: in every place, wherever we go, say of me, “He "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " my brother.” ’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Abimelech took sheep, oxen, and male and female servants, and gave "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Abraham; and he restored Sarah his wife to him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Abimelech said, “See, my land "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " before you; dwell where it pleases you.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then to Sarah he said, “Behold, I have given your brother a thousand "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "pieces"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of silver; indeed this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. is a covering of the eyes for you to all"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "vindicates you before all who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you and before everybody.” Thus she was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or justified"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "rebuked."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Abraham prayed to God; and God healed Abimelech, his wife, and his female servants. Then they bore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "children;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " had closed up all the wombs of the house of Abimelech because of Sarah, Abraham’s wife."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}